WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.400
- Welcome to The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.700
in part taping right in my home.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.970
Yep, I'm still in
COVID/flu/cold recovery protocol

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.920
so I have a little bit more time

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.472
to be home for the holidays.

00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:15.805
♪ Home for the holidays ♪

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.620
All right, but we've got a
whole audience in the studio

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.240
truly in the Christmas spirit.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.001
Let me hear y'all, give it to me!

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:26.040
(audience cheering)

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.040
And as always, we're gonna
dive straight in with music

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.110
except this is a little different,

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.460
and I'm very excited.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.080
Instead of a standard Kelly-oke,

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.260
I have a good friend and
super talented singer.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.790
She's right there to lift you up

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.740
with a signature song of the season.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.573
You're gonna love this.

00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:42.630
It's beautiful.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.220
It's a Jewel-aoke

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.230
of "Have Yourself a
Merry Little Christmas."

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.230
(audience cheering)

00:00:58.961 --> 00:01:03.961
♪ Have yourself a merry little Christmas ♪

00:01:06.837 --> 00:01:11.837
♪ Let your heart be light ♪

00:01:13.117 --> 00:01:18.117
♪ From now on our troubles
will be out of sight ♪

00:01:29.883 --> 00:01:34.883
♪ Through the years we
all will be together ♪

00:01:38.892 --> 00:01:43.892
♪ If the fates allow ♪

00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:48.364
♪ To hang our shining ♪

00:01:48.364 --> 00:01:53.364
♪ Hang a shining star
above the highest bough ♪

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.519
♪ And have yourself ♪

00:02:02.519 --> 00:02:06.102
♪ A merry little Christmas ♪

00:02:18.063 --> 00:02:19.896
♪ Now ♪

00:02:20.999 --> 00:02:23.999
